# harmony: a follower takes its pitches from the conductor's chord instead of the scale
wait 200
turn ALGO 1
expect trk 2
knob 2 brain harmony
expect par2.brain 3
knob 3 brain ch._deg
expect par3.brain 4
# a track's SEL list names the mode
tap EDIT
tap SEL
row FOLLOWS CONDUCTOR
wait 40
shot harmony_list.png
tap HOME
# the conductor's held keys are its chord (C E G); the Engine page shows it beside the degree
spin ALGO 7
expect trk 9
tap EDIT
play 9 60 on
play 9 64 on
play 9 67 on
wait 40
shot harmony_chord.png
play 9 60 off
play 9 64 off
play 9 67 off
# the routing page: a bar marks the harmony modes
turn SELECT 1
wait 40
shot harmony_routing.png
